{"formal_ids": ["GS-769"], "labels": ["二阶导数误差界", "分部积分法", "定积分", "拉格朗日余项", "泰勒公式", "积分三角不等式"], "metadata": {"capture_ids": ["MFI-CAP-0d3f33c7e9ebde19fac049fe"], "closeout_id": "MFI-CLOSE-47bb5409c99c7ae4164b2d5b", "conversation_complete": true, "coverage": "full_bytes", "files": [{"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-e4ebcc54d9cc3782942f392d/conversation.json", "sha256": "31a63102c7f5d6d10577f0ffee9676a7d3b4d4063f54aa153eb6c49026d7cde1", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Users/xiazhibin/Documents/kaoyan-math/数学一回滚复习系统/快速入库来源/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-e4ebcc54d9cc3782942f392d/source.json", "sha256": "2fa3fffb3c2fb64c2b583d37c096418f48162089e32d218fcb454e2d3866fe32", "status": "verified", "text_status": "available"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-e4ebcc54d9cc3782942f392d/attachments/explanation_image_01.png", "sha256": "389438fae5c6b0c65a340924225692157c5f55983f87cd54e7e542b3aadf3191", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}, {"path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-e4ebcc54d9cc3782942f392d/attachments/question_image_01.png", "sha256": "79d958460c9ba2170afdbee016e330e4b519524151572829ffc68defe98a091a", "status": "verified", "text_status": "text_unavailable_no_ocr"}], "original_path": "/Volumes/T9-Data/03_数学/资料库/原始会话资料/2026-08-31/MATHPKG-e4ebcc54d9cc3782942f392d", "original_sha256": "b0ab5c9962efb5747e919019a8d28dd56dc61e854a42c1673e618f3706fcbbd9", "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-6e348b92e5c9a90e6169c64d", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/5bfb6457f91178e0817369d79f95f5135628df56ce4d61571b1b6716c4795657.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "5bfb6457f91178e0817369d79f95f5135628df56ce4d61571b1b6716c4795657", "user_turn_count": 5, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 490], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "bb2fe1edc4fe85d0c2755f8a62efd81a7d7696f65fc19c83c62ac796ce7f509f", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 157], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "f261f256170255b314e12ed1ac067b7e04b76ec89b0f3641c05366d892a446c7", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 27], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "dbf04306b7edc78cdcbba9e125fd21ea226498cc5664db3d3c05a105c3dd6205", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}, {"character_range": [0, 225], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "65ee875beaac6572ddfd58fab7b7f8439fcb9178f2f3853089cf6ce78729592e", "role": "user", "sequence": 7}, {"character_range": [0, 10], "next_role": null, "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "8c156bdfa7b1efc9ff1d2dad7dfda84096af94e4f8dbb138ddbf12add90c4d63", "role": "user", "sequence": 9}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这是答案的题图和解析图。\n\n这道题第一问是用分部积分去做的，这我完全没想到。因为看到题目给出了连续二阶导数，我下意识觉得这个隐含条件是可以用泰勒公式去做，于是就把泰勒公式在 a 点和 b 点处分别展开了。\n\n展开之后：\nf(x) = f(a) + f'(a)(x - a) + (1/2)f''(ξ)(x - a)²\n在 b 点处也是一样展开。\n\n接着我对这两边在 [a, b] 上做积分，f(a) 和 f(b) 项积分出来刚好等于 f(a)(b - a) 和 f(b)(b - a)。两式相加之后，刚好凑出了 ∫[a,b] f(x)dx 和 (1/2)(b - a)(f(a) + f(b)) 这一部分。\n\n但我后面想着把剩下的两项也凑成解析里的 (1/2)∫[a,b] (x - a)(x - b)f''(ξ)dx 时，就完全凑不出来了，直接卡住。\n\n我看解析第一问非常简单，直接用分部积分就做出来了。想问下我这道题是哪里出了问题：\n\n1. 用泰勒公式到底还能不能继续往下做出来？\n2. 用泰勒公式是不是绕远了？\n3. 这道题到底是怎么想到要立马用分部积分去做的？我不是很理解"}